# Source files containing translatable strings (T-107).
#
# Listed paths are relative to the project root. xgettext (invoked by
# meson `i18n.gettext()`) extracts every literal passed to a
# `gettext(...)` call in these files into the .pot template.
#
# Blueprint (.blp) files carry `_("...")` markers too, but extracting
# from .blp via xgettext requires either:
#   (a) `blueprint-compiler pot` (writes a .pot fragment), or
#   (b) extracting from the generated .ui via `--language=Glade`.
# Neither is wired here — the v0.2 scaffolding is Rust-only. The
# Blueprint extraction is queued for v0.6 polish (T-500+); the
# `_("...")` markers in *.blp stay so the v0.6 follow-up has source
# to extract from.

crates/obsbot-gui/src/application.rs
crates/obsbot-gui/src/controls_view.rs
crates/obsbot-gui/src/exposure_group.rs
crates/obsbot-gui/src/ptz_pad.rs
crates/obsbot-gui/src/wb_group.rs
crates/obsbot-gui/src/window.rs
